Wyatt Earp's Revenge is a 2012 American Western film
about the legendary lawman Wyatt Earp.

13
00:59:48,000 --> 00:59:54,000
It is a fictionalized account of an actual Old West event, the slaying of beautiful
singer Dora Hand in Dodge City, Kansas, when Earp was a deputy there.

14
01:04:24,000 --> 01:04:30,000
In one of its many instances of dramatic license, the
movie depicts Hand as Earp's sweetheart.

15
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
The film's framing device is a reporter's interview with an
aging Earp, who reminisces about the tragedy.

16
